OL,5,G1400 Police Interceptors
OL,6,     FThe interceptors have to drop
OL,7,     Feverything when a speeding 4x4
OL,8,     Frushes past them. The Stanway team
OL,9,     Fpursues a man with a machete.
OL,10,G1500 Police Interceptors
OL,11,     FA look back at the highlights of
OL,12,     Fthe series, including efforts to
OL,13,     Fcatch a stolen 4x4 that tries to
OL,14,     Frun a police Evo off the road.
OL,15,G1600 Police Interceptors
OL,16,     FThe team joins forces with the
OL,17,     Fchopper to track down a wanted
OL,18,     Fcriminal on a motorbike, and a
OL,19,     Fyoung driver crashes straight into
OL,20,     Fan unmarked police car.
