OL,5,G1700 Shoplifters: Caught Red Handed
OL,6,     FIn West Orchards, Coventry,
OL,7,     Fthere's a stand-off between guards
OL,8,     Fand a gang in a premium store. In
OL,9,     FLondon, CCTV is needed when a
OL,10,     Fwoman is suspected of being on the
OL,11,     Fpinch. (Ep15)
OL,12,G1800 Home and Away
OL,13,     FLevi makes a solid effort. Remi
OL,14,     Fgets his groove back. Spirits are
OL,15,     Fhigh at the Surf Club fundraiser.
