OL,5,G2200 A&E After Dark
OL,6,     FThe staff of Hull Royal Infirmary
OL,7,     Fis shocked when a young man is
OL,8,     Fbrought in with life-threatening
OL,9,     Fstab wounds.
OL,10,G2300 Trauma Room One
OL,11,     FFifty-year-old Theresa has been
OL,12,     Frushed in after sudden, severe
OL,13,     Fneck pain and weakness in her arms
OL,14,     Fand legs. Surgeons fear without
OL,15,     Furgent surgery she could be
OL,16,     Fparalysed... (Ep6)
OL,17,G0000 Skin A&E
OL,18,     FDr Natalia Spierings gets a face
OL,19,     Ffull of cyst contents, Dr Emma
OL,20,     FMcMullen helps a young mum with a
OL,21,     Fsatsuma-sized lipoma and Dr Magnus
OL,22,     FLynch burns off some facial warts.
